Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:04.67,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,Damn that Krai...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.67,0:00:07.83,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,It's the same excuse every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.83,0:00:09.60,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,What the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.60,0:00:10.90,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,Sven!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.90,0:00:12.85,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,I wish I could help you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:17.04,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,I've got a mountain of questions for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:19.12,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,Obsidian Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:22.55,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,I believe you said you came \Nhere to obtain a quest?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.55,0:00:23.36,Flashback,Sven,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.36,0:00:25.77,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,You guys are trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:27.54,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to spring this on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.54,0:00:30.47,Flashback,Gark,0,0,0,,but could I ask you to\Ninvestigate the White Wolf's Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:34.62,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,You really roped us in, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:38.14,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Once again, we're all dancing\Nin the palm of your hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.75,0:00:41.96,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:47.10,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,We are now in the golden age \Nof the treasure hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.10,0:00:50.44,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Amid the sparkling talent on \Ndisplay in the capital of Zebrudia,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.44,0:00:53.41,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,there was one man who stood \Nout amongst all others!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.41,0:00:56.15,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,His name is Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.95,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,This is an epic tale \Nfull of glory and agony,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.95,0:01:01.00,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of how he became renowned \Nfor being the leader
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.00,0:01:03.82,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,of the strongest party he founded \Nwith his childhood friends,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.82,0:01:07.32,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,and also the master of the strongest clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.50,0:02:01.25,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Krai, this is the thing you \Nrequested the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:02.13,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.13,0:02:02.98,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.68,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,There's a lead on you-know-what, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.68,0:02:05.51,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:08.52,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 06
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.52,0:02:08.52,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}I Want to Sleep Instead of Taking Charge
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.81,0:02:08.16,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"I Want to Sleep Instead of Taking Charge."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.20,0:02:27.00,Show Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,700)\pos(324,269)\fscx95\fscy76}Let This Grieving Soul Retire
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.54,0:02:44.84,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Date! Date!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.84,0:02:46.80,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Today, I'm on another date with Krai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.80,0:02:48.48,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Calm down, Liz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.48,0:02:50.07,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We're not going on a date today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:54.31,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,This is the unsafest \Nneighborhood in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.82,0:02:59.32,Default,Chinpi,0,0,0,,That's the S-Stifled Shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.32,0:03:01.32,Default,Rah,0,0,0,,What's she doing in a place like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.10,0:03:06.78,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,So, do you have some kind of business \Nto take care of here, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.78,0:03:08.77,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.70,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,According to Eva's information,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.00,0:03:17.20,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,one person after another has \Ngone missing in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.55,0:03:21.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not that disappearances are \Nsuper uncommon in the slum quarter,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.07,0:03:26.23,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but it would be really bad if \NSitri's Slime was attacking people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.87,0:03:28.93,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.93,0:03:31.91,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,it looks like there's a new \Nice cream shop around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.91,0:03:33.61,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's two birds with one stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:38.84,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's really just like Eva to take \Nme seriously and look that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:40.11,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:44.09,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Why don't we check out that \Nice cream shop up ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.00,0:03:47.23,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.53,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,What are those two doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.02,0:03:56.00,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,I-Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.00,0:03:57.61,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.61,0:03:59.67,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,I was sure I wasn't being followed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.31,0:04:03.26,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,So letting me get away was a trap after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:06.67,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.01,0:04:09.87,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,Nobody could know that this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:13.49,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,newly opened ice cream shop is one \Nof our research facilities...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:17.03,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,But still, Thousand Tricks is here...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.03,0:04:19.31,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,At any rate, we're closing for the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:23.03,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.38,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.06,0:04:27.99,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I've returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.99,0:04:30.69,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,Y-Y-Y-You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.38,0:04:30.69,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.69,0:04:34.20,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,You're back, Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.47,0:04:40.72,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,We know you're in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:42.09,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.01,0:04:44.69,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,How dare you...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:45.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:47.41,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:49.19,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They're closed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.56,0:04:55.10,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But I can smell something sweet, and \NI'm pretty sure they were open a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.38,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.38,0:04:59.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,We shouldn't bother the \Nstore owners, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.15,0:05:01.61,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:03.62,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,They probably ran out of ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.62,0:05:04.87,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That was fruitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.83,0:05:20.05,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Because you didn't get to eat ice cream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.31,0:05:22.42,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:26.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,In the end, I couldn't find \NSitri's Slime anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.39,0:05:28.67,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I guess if a threat to the\Ncapital were on the loose,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.67,0:05:31.02,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,it wouldn't be this quiet...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.68,0:05:34.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But I really wonder where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:35.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Liz?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:39.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,When is Sitri getting back \Nfrom the Night Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.45,0:05:40.89,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Si?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.89,0:05:43.08,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I could just do whatever you need done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.08,0:05:45.94,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I need someone with knowledge\Nof magical organisms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.94,0:05:47.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.87,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess she's the \Nonly one who can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.87,0:05:53.30,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,She took all kinds of equipment with her,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:54.88,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,so I think she'll be a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.88,0:05:56.20,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.20,0:05:57.57,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.57,0:05:58.90,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.22,0:06:00.75,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,She'll be back soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:01.42,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:02.71,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.91,0:06:05.13,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Eva!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.13,0:06:05.81,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.81,0:06:06.71,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.27,0:06:09.81,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I've selected the members \Nwho will aid the Association
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.81,0:06:13.71,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,in the investigation \Nof the White Wolf's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:16.10,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Ark is not present,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:19.98,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,but Sven and his group \Nhave already gone ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.17,0:06:20.78,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:21.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I'll let you handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.72,0:06:24.45,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,The investigation party will leave tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.45,0:06:26.74,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,An expert in relic research \Nwill also be dispatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.74,0:06:29.14,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,so it will be a very \Nthorough investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:31.33,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,This has become quite the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.33,0:06:34.72,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not that I'm going, so \Nit's none of my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.72,0:06:36.90,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Is there something of concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.90,0:06:39.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,No, no, that sounds fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.83,0:06:42.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If it's members of Steps, \Nthey'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.58,0:06:43.77,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Yup, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:45.49,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.17,0:06:48.50,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Then I will make the preparations.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.31,0:06:53.02,Default,Hoss,0,0,0,,That Thousand Tricks is \Nnot to be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.02,0:06:57.28,Default,Hoss,0,0,0,,I can't believe he found our facility \Nin the slums that easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.28,0:07:00.37,Default,Nole,0,0,0,,That ice cream shop was a perfect front.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.18,0:07:04.58,Default,Nole,0,0,0,,Does this mean his intelligence \Nnetwork is better than ours?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.58,0:07:07.14,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,And yet he just walked away!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.62,0:07:09.91,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,He's incomprehensible!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:12.05,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,There's no need to be frightened by pranks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.14,0:07:19.54,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,But how should we proceed while we are \Nuncertain of what Thousand Tricks is truly after?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.51,0:07:23.70,Default,Nole,0,0,0,,What do you think, Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.09,0:07:25.43,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Let us fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:29.04,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,We're up against a level 8!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:30.73,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Do we have any chance of winning?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.73,0:07:32.41,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.96,0:07:35.56,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,The Akashic Tower is in \Npursuit of the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.56,0:07:37.57,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,The laws may not approve of our methods,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.57,0:07:41.44,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,but there is no enemy we \Nneed shy away from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.79,0:07:44.68,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,They are a group of high-level hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.68,0:07:50.32,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,This is the perfect opportunity to see how \Neffective the defense system I've built is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:52.22,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,If we eliminate them all,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.22,0:07:55.20,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,we don't have to worry about our \Ninformation being compromised further.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.30,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.03,0:07:59.45,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.69,0:08:02.07,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Since we've already been sniffed \Nout by Thousand Tricks,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.07,0:08:05.21,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,there is no way for us to escape \Ncompletely unscathed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.47,0:08:08.60,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,We may as well rid ourselves \Nof them in one fell swoop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.23,0:08:12.71,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Sophia, do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:15.21,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Please let me take care of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.21,0:08:16.83,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.45,0:08:31.61,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Liz is really something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.61,0:08:33.16,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I don't have a single bruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.80,0:08:40.35,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,She must have soaked me in potions \Nand thrown me into bed after I fainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.22,0:08:47.33,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,I'm glad I survived...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:54.81,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,Why so many carriages?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.49,0:09:02.06,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.06,0:09:03.07,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Tino.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.07,0:09:04.64,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,You haven't heard?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.64,0:09:08.15,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,We're going into the White Wolf's Den \Nin collaboration with the Association.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:09.91,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,With this many people?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.91,0:09:13.31,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I guess Master's plan was to deploy Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.32,0:09:16.52,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Sounds like a joke, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:22.28,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Sending the capital's best level 7 \Nhunter to a level 3 treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.28,0:09:24.65,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,The only thing it smells of is danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:28.07,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,However, Ark Brave isn't around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:31.34,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,What you see here are the "replacements."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.34,0:09:33.99,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,You think these people can handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.46,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.46,0:09:38.00,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Obsidian Cross has gone ahead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.00,0:09:40.96,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,but even they can't replace Ark Brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.34,0:09:43.04,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Only the Grievers could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.33,0:09:48.20,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,Has the White Wolf's Den's \Nlevel gone up since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.98,0:09:51.99,Internal,Tino(M),0,0,0,,And if it has, what's going on over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:55.81,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.81,0:09:57.74,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What's all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.74,0:09:59.64,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,What are all these people doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.64,0:10:01.24,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Is there some kind of festival going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:03.51,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,This is regarding what we \Nspoke about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.89,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, right. That.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.89,0:10:08.75,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Since you had requested Ark,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:11.75,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,I tried to assemble a group that \Napproximates his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.75,0:10:14.19,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,If this isn't to your liking, I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.19,0:10:18.27,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Hold on... It's true that I wanted \Nto shove this onto Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.27,0:10:23.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,But that's because he's such a nice guy who \Nalways gets everything done with a smile,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.39,0:10:25.13,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,which means I can relax in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:27.52,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Not to mention,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.52,0:10:31.03,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,sending this many people\Nis gonna cost an arm and a leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.03,0:10:32.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Who's going to pay for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:35.62,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Our members are all elites,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.62,0:10:38.05,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,so I think half of them should be \Nable to handle it with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.04,0:10:41.53,Default,Inthatcase,0,0,0,,Half?! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.53,0:10:44.41,Default,Eina,0,0,0,,Ark was requested to handle this, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.13,0:10:51.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What could happen at a \Nlevel 3 treasure vault?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.17,0:10:53.24,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Everyone, please listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.93,0:10:56.56,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Krai has something to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:59.52,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I wonder who that Krai is...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.67,0:11:05.45,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Everyone, calm yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.45,0:11:08.15,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,This treasure vault was originally level 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.15,0:11:10.26,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,You can definitely handle \Nit with just half of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:11.30,Default,Dunbelieveyu,0,0,0,,Lies!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:12.57,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,It's not a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.97,0:11:15.08,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Ugh, even Tino?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:17.47,Default,Inthatcase,0,0,0,,Have mercy, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.47,0:11:19.57,Default,Inthatcase,0,0,0,,You're starting to worry us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:23.09,Default,Eina,0,0,0,,Is there an irrefutable reason that you \Nreally have to reduce our numbers?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.49,0:11:26.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Is there going to be a \Nproper reward for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.72,0:11:28.34,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.34,0:11:31.51,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Gark has acquired additional funding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.51,0:11:32.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.22,0:11:35.57,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,So we solved the money issue,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.57,0:11:38.67,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,but I still haven't found Sitri's Slime...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,What if it's inside the White Wolf's Den?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.48,0:11:44.83,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, well. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.30,0:11:47.11,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's... fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.11,0:11:49.72,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,If you guys want to do it that way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.72,0:11:51.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I have no right to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:55.27,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,If this may people go and there's nothing \Nthere, I won't take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:58.60,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Gark has words for me, I'm \Ngoing to feign ignorance so hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.99,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This is so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.83,0:12:03.21,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,If it were me, I wouldn't even take half,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.21,0:12:05.11,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'd go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:07.98,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai's demands are always high,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:10.74,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,but you shouldn't have\Nanything to complain about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.74,0:12:12.51,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Right, Krai?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.51,0:12:13.74,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.03,0:12:17.27,Default,Tomado,0,0,0,,That's because you're so strong,\N Stifled Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.27,0:12:18.60,Top,Doi,0,0,0,,He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.79,0:12:19.72,Default,Hunters,0,0,0,,You don't get it cuz you're tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:20.94,Top,Hunters,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.72,0:12:22.91,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I get why Krai is getting fed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.91,0:12:27.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,This is {\i1}exactly{\i0} why you guys \Nare stuck where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.00,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.95,0:12:35.24,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, I'll take on this job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.24,0:12:36.24,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,With Ti.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:37.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.86,0:12:39.61,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,But why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.61,0:12:41.27,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Because I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:43.79,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,That would be too cruel for Tino,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.21,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,plus there are already other people there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:49.82,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I can picture exactly what would \Nhappen if Liz went there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:53.28,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I've decided to have everyone \Nhere go after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.79,0:12:56.25,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.25,0:13:00.19,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Then will you lead everyone in the vault?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.81,0:13:05.17,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,I see! If our level 8 master \Nis there, it won't be so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:08.77,Default,Tino,0,0,0,,With Master's powers, those \Nphantoms will be a piece of cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.46,0:13:11.45,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Why is everyone getting hyped up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.45,0:13:12.77,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.28,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,Are you stupid? Why would I go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:19.85,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hm, I think there are people \Nbetter suited to leadership,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.85,0:13:20.79,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,like Sven, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.79,0:13:22.76,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Obsidian Cross is already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.56,0:13:25.52,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I have a great idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.34,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,All right. I suppose I will go as well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:29.57,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Wait, you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.90,0:13:33.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,However, there are some pressing \Nmatters I cannot delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.02,0:13:34.40,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I will join you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:38.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Until then, I'll delegate \Nleadership to Obsidian Cross.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:43.55,Default,Eva,0,0,0,,Understood. Everyone, \Nplease prepare for departure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:50.87,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm going to casually stroll in \Nwhen things are wrapping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.54,0:13:56.43,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What a letdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.43,0:13:59.20,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Sure, the level of the phantoms {\i1}\Nhas{\i0} gone up...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.58,0:14:01.94,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,But other than that, nothing stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.94,0:14:04.16,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Let's just move on for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.91,0:14:11.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why can't I come?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.71,0:14:14.70,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why? I wanna go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.29,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.29,0:14:17.20,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.45,0:14:19.90,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.97,0:14:20.66,Top,Krai,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.66,0:14:25.58,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I, uh... need you to, you \Nknow, do something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:26.71,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.71,0:14:28.43,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Yes, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.43,0:14:32.52,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Oh, why didn't you say so earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.91,0:14:30.52,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I had to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.52,0:14:32.99,Top Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,or else she would just grab\NTino and run ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.99,0:14:33.80,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Krai.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.94,0:14:38.40,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Should we be on the lookout for anything \Nin particular during this mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:40.33,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.23,0:14:45.24,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,I don't know if it'll appear,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:48.55,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,but if you run into some sort of slime-like thing, you should be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.55,0:14:49.62,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,A slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.04,0:14:53.35,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Why would a slime appear in \Nthe White Wolf's Den?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.35,0:14:56.08,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,That's why I said I don't \Nknow {\i1}if{\i0} it'll appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.78,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,But if it does,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:00.39,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,it's not a normal slime, so be cautious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:03.58,Default,Lyle,0,0,0,,Got it. I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.39,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I think this time it was \Nreally too random...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.01,0:15:11.30,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:15.40,Default,Nole,0,0,0,,Damn these hunters!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.40,0:15:18.77,Default,Nole,0,0,0,,I can't believe they sent this many...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.23,0:15:24.02,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,The arrogance of confronting \Nus mages directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.53,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,This is the pinnacle of our research,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:29.12,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,the mana material agitation device.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:32.58,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,If they impede our pursuit of the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.58,0:15:34.03,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,our only choice is to crush them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.03,0:15:36.38,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,But we're facing Thousand Tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.38,0:15:39.78,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,If his party, Grieving Souls, \Nwere to mobilize,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.36,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,it'd be a real problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.36,0:15:42.79,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,That won't be an issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.30,0:15:46.96,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,It's true that they are one \Nof the capital's top parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.45,0:15:52.98,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,But my defense system is \Nready to repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.98,0:16:01.32,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Besides, there are only two—no, three \Nof the Grieving Souls in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.52,0:16:04.39,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks, Krai Andrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.39,0:16:06.79,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Stifled Shadow, Liz Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.79,0:16:11.57,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,And that vexing alchemist, Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.84,0:16:14.29,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Most of them are not present?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.29,0:16:16.73,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,How did you find that out?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.18,0:16:21.25,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Flick, I'm no research-obsessed fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.25,0:16:25.21,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I have eyes in many places where \Nthe Akashic Tower has none.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:30.84,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,If you have provisions against physical \Nattacks, dealing with Stifled Shadow is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.84,0:16:33.65,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Furthermore, Thousand Tricks, \Nas the brain of the party,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.65,0:16:38.09,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,cannot unleash his full potential without \Nhis party members to direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.93,0:16:42.36,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Then the only problem is Sitri Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.45,0:16:44.37,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:49.36,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I've used numerous techniques to construct \Nthe defense system for this facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:53.87,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,It's impossible for an alchemist who\N abides by the laws to overcome it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.52,0:16:57.04,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,That woman is my nemesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.53,0:17:00.88,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,I need to do everything I can \Nto obliterate her completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.28,0:17:04.97,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Sitri has been sniffing \Naround this research,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:08.08,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,based on the thesis you \Nleft behind in the empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.08,0:17:09.14,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.14,0:17:14.60,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,The research of mana material is the essence \Nof the sublime ideal of the Master of Mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.87,0:17:18.12,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,It's not something that \Nfilthy Sitri may approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.46,0:17:21.52,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,Master, please grant me permission
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.52,0:17:25.39,Default,Sophia,0,0,0,,to use everything we've created \Nthus far to rid us of these intruders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.91,0:17:27.52,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.13,0:17:31.10,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Flick, and everyone else present:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.10,0:17:33.02,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Follow Sophia's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:36.36,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Consider Sophia's words to be my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:38.66,Default,Noctus,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.11,0:17:39.95,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.41,0:17:45.23,Default,Flick,0,0,0,,All for your sublime task!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.16,0:17:51.47,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Nothing out of the ordinary here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:56.95,Default,Marietta,0,0,0,,Was it perhaps overkill for us to \Nbe dispatched for this request?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:58.98,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,What choice did we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:02.05,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It came directly from Gark himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.05,0:18:04.61,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,I'll trust your judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:10.57,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,However, this almost feels like \Nwe're cleaning up the Master's mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.74,0:18:13.42,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:16.32,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But you know, Henrik, one of these \Ndays you'll also understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.11,0:18:18.24,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:26.32,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Got it. Thanks for telling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.07,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,The situation has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.07,0:18:29.84,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We'll head out for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.33,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Blow the whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.33,0:18:32.38,Default,Henrik,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.54,0:18:40.29,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Yo, yo, Crosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.29,0:18:42.06,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Give me a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.06,0:18:43.72,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Did you {\i1}seriously{\i0} use the emergency signal
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.72,0:18:46.28,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,even though there's nothing \Nout of the ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.28,0:18:47.09,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.09,0:18:50.01,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Did any of you find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.01,0:18:52.45,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,According to the information \Nthe Crosses got,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.45,0:18:56.30,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,we're supposed to watch out for a slime.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:18:58.85,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,So, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.85,0:19:02.06,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,You're telling me you \Ntrust the word of some guy
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:05.85,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,who's lazing about in the city \Nmore than the evidence here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:06.73,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.73,0:19:08.12,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Are you shitting me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:09.00,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:12.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,We used the signal out of kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.50,0:19:13.74,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:18.86,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,If it were the Grieving Souls instead \Nof us, they'd never use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.86,0:19:21.19,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Krai would say it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.19,0:19:24.14,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Liz or Luke have no interest \Nin weaker people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.42,0:19:27.89,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Sitri would deliberately send \Nyou ahead and study you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.33,0:19:32.50,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But every member of our party is a healer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.50,0:19:36.64,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It goes against our style to look \Naway and allow people to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.94,0:19:40.07,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's not too late to resume the \Ninvestigation after our reinforcements arrive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.40,0:19:42.59,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,But if you want to die, do as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:45.31,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,But that's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.31,0:19:47.28,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Watch out for a slime?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.28,0:19:51.02,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Why would a trash monster \Nlike that appear here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:57.06,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,In the past, Krai once suggested we all go \Nout for a cherry blossom viewing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:20:01.18,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Since it was outside the city, he told \Nus to bring our weapons just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:02.76,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Cherry blossom viewing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.76,0:20:04.81,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,What are you on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.81,0:20:09.12,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,The place we went is now a treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.07,0:20:14.51,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen the moment \Na treasure vault materializes?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.51,0:20:18.06,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,All right, everyone. Let's begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.23,0:20:19.61,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,It's almost as if...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.61,0:20:22.11,Flashback,Krai,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.83,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,...hell had seeped into our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.15,0:20:28.59,Default,Gain,0,0,0,,Are you talking about... the Prism Garden?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:31.66,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Thousand Tricks can see the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.08,0:20:35.45,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,The reason we spent an enormous \Namount to get this Sounding Stone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:38.22,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,was to obtain information more quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:41.79,Default,Sven,0,0,0,,Information from him is that valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:45.15,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.15,0:20:47.59,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Krai, when are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.86,0:20:49.17,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,What did you have to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.17,0:20:51.03,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:52.96,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Hey. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:57.38,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,I'm so excited to fight in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.38,0:21:00.03,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Last time I couldn't go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.86,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Right, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.24,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,I did say I'd go,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.24,0:21:07.17,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,and I do want to show up when the \Ninvestigation is done, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:13.34,Internal,Krai(M),0,0,0,,It's hard to know when the \Nright time to leave is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.62,0:21:16.40,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.87,0:21:20.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.13,0:21:24.89,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:27.02,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome back, Sitri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:28.65,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why so soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.65,0:21:30.26,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Did you come back alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.26,0:21:31.31,Default,Liz,0,0,0,,Why, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:35.64,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,You're one to talk,\Nafter you abandoned our party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:39.36,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Krai, I thought you might need my skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.36,0:21:40.64,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,so I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.15,0:21:42.67,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I had a bad feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.67,0:21:43.40,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.86,0:21:45.75,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,It's a powerful enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.75,0:21:48.35,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,We need to crush them before \Nthey gain any more power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.16,0:21:55.09,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sitri Smart has finally \Nreturned to our Krai Andrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.99,0:22:00.12,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,The treasure vault White Wolf's\N Den has inexplicably changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:03.64,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sitri's Slime is still missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.44,0:22:08.18,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,And the secret organization, \NAkashic Tower, is moving in the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:11.47,Internal,Narrator,0,0,0,,Please tune in again next time!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.68,0:22:15.57,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Um, are you really going,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:16.73,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,Branch Manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.73,0:22:19.53,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.97,0:22:21.94,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,But you're retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.94,0:22:25.38,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,We have the full support\Nof First Steps in this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.38,0:22:27.82,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,You should leave this to the young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.28,0:22:32.45,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I will not tolerate Liz making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:35.96,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,I can still keep up with those youngsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:38.65,Default,Kaina,0,0,0,,You're so immature...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.05,0:22:40.35,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,Gark.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:42.62,Default,Gark,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.79,0:22:45.64,Default,Sitri,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.19,0:23:30.08,Top,Noctus,0,0,0,,Akashic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.63,0:23:44.65,EpTitle,txt,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(479.445,354.111)}By: Noctus and Disciples feat. Sophia
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.08,0:23:30.63,Top,Sophia,0,0,0,,A!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.63,0:23:32.76,Top,All,0,0,0,,All for the pursuit! Akashic Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.76,0:23:33.34,Top,Noctus,0,0,0,,Akashic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.34,0:23:33.75,Top,Sophia,0,0,0,,Ka!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.75,0:23:35.87,Top,All,0,0,0,,Calling on you to prepare \Nyourself! Akashic Tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:36.44,Top,Noctus,0,0,0,,Akashic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.44,0:23:36.88,Top,Sophia,0,0,0,,Shic!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:39.68,Top,All,0,0,0,,Shic shank mages, for our mentor!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.68,0:23:40.71,Top,Sophia,0,0,0,,Shic shank...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.01,0:23:42.89,Top,Sophia,0,0,0,,Next time, on {\i1}Let This Grieving Soul{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.89,0:23:44.32,Top,All,0,0,0,,...{\i1}Retire{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.32,0:23:46.96,Top,Noctus,0,0,0,,Submit to us, Thousand Tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:49.94,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\c&H00BAFF&\pos(320.52,100.623)}Episode 07
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.65,0:23:49.94,EpTitle,Title,0,0,0,,{\fs30\bord3\pos(322.143,238.714)\c&HD1D1D1&}The Akashic Tower Wants to Experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.96,0:23:49.23,Default,Krai,0,0,0,,"The Akashic Tower Wants to Experiment."
